sequenceDiagram
    participant DSP as DSP API Server
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WFC as Workflow Controller<br/>9090/TCP metrics
    participant Pod as Workflow Pod
    participant Exec as argoexec<br/>(sidecar in Pod)
    participant S3 as Artifact Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over DSP,S3: Flow 1: Workflow Execution

    DSP->>K8s: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>WFC: Watch event: new Workflow<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token

    loop For each workflow step
        WFC->>K8s: Create Pod for step<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>Pod: Pod scheduled and started
        Note over Exec,Pod: argoexec injected as sidecar
        Exec->>Exec: Manage main container lifecycle
        Exec->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>HTTPS / Cloud credentials
        S3-->>Exec: Upload confirmed
        Exec->>K8s: Report WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>WFC: Watch event: task result<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    end

    WFC->>K8s: Update Workflow status (Succeeded/Failed)<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token

    Note over DSP,S3: Flow 2: CronWorkflow Scheduling

    WFC->>K8s: Watch CronWorkflow CRs<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>WFC: CronWorkflow detected

    loop On cron schedule
        WFC->>K8s: Create Workflow CR<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
        Note over WFC: Follows Flow 1 for execution
    end
